Univariate Analysis
we run analysis in only one col at a time

Data Type: Numerical , Categorical data

--> Categorical Data
**on Categorical data you can use bar graph (to get the numerical value)**
----------> to get the percentage of the above thing you can use PIE CHART 

--> Numerical Data 
----------> Histogram (you can use histogram to get the detail about the data 
and you can also set the bins to know more about it  )

----------> DistPlot (it is same as histogram but with PDF )

----------> BoxPlot (5 row summary , finding outlier)  


--------------------Bivariate-------------------- 
Numerical -- Numerical  (scatter plot, group plot)
Categorical -- Categorical (Heat map,cluster map ) 
Numerical -- Categorical (Bar Plot, Distplot, heatmap)

